# In dev, vite.config.ts proxies /api to http://localhost:8000 - point that
# at a running engine/api server (see engine/Dockerfile, or the no-spend
# dev server under engine/api/dev_server.py).

# The Conversation Transparency Engine's own flag - unset everywhere, not wired into the Docker build
# (Build/Ministry/Features/Conversation-Transparency-Engine/Decision-Log.md,
# Entry 41: "no deployment config currently sets
# VITE_TRANSPARENCY_ANCHOR_RENDERER at all... flipping it later is a
# deploy-config change, not a code change"). Listed here for the same
# local-testing reason, not touched or owned by this file's edit.
# VITE_TRANSPARENCY_ANCHOR_RENDERER=on
